{"sourceUrl":"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/chemcn/2025/0728/c34735a3071801/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.248466+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/chemcn/2025/0728/c34735a3071801/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>欢迎优秀应届本科生申请浙江大学化学系<span>2026</span>年推免研究生。相关说明如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、招收类型</span></strong></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span>类型</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业代码</span></p></td><td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td><td><p><span>拟招推免生类型</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>学术学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>070300</span></p></td><td><p><span>化学</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士、直博</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>085600</span></p></td><td><p><span>材料与化工</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>专业学位</span></p></td><td><p><span>086000</span></p></td><td><p><span>生物与医药</span></p></td><td><p><span>推免硕士</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong><span>二、关于报名</span></strong></p><p><span>申请浙江大学化学系<span>2026</span>年推免研究生，须在浙江大学推免报名系统中提交申请，<strong><span>申请时间为</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>28</span><span>日</span><span>-9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span></strong>，报名截止前可在系统中修改报考信息。</span></p><p><span>申请条件、报名方式和报名流程等详见</span><span><span>“</span></span><strong><span><span><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2025/0728/c28479a3071793/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">浙江大学关于<span>2026</span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知</a></span></span></strong><span><span>”</span></span><span>。其中，报考直博一般需满足以下英语成绩要求：大学英语六级<span>460</span>分及以上，或<span>WSK</span>（<span>PETS 5</span>）合格，或英语专业八级合格，成绩有效期为五年，即<span>2021</span>年<span>6</span>月及以后的成绩有效；或雅思<span>5.5</span>分及以上，或托福<span>80</span>分及以上，成绩有效期参照证书的有效期。</span></p><p><span>申请材料：（<span>1</span>）有效身份证扫描件；（<span>2</span>）本科阶段成绩单，加盖教务部门公章；（<span>3</span>）外语水平证明材料；（<span>4</span>）推免直博，还须提供2封报考学科领域内副高及以上职称专家的</span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/52686959dcbd6ca4246b.gif\"/></span></span><span><span><a href=\"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/4c/8a/812c47214e71b685c0a856ace537/b14dff3e-3123-41bc-ac83-573776cc8b70.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>推荐信.docx</strong></a></span></span><span>（专家手写签名或电子签名）；（<span>5</span>）其他重要证明材料（自选上传）。<strong><span>请严格按照上述顺序将材料依次扫描并合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span>文档在报名系统的“附件材料”中上传</span>。</strong></span></p><p><strong><span>三、其他</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>请积极联系导师，尽早明确研究兴趣和攻读类型，化学系导师目录详见：</span><a href=\"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/chemcn/axw/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span><span><span>点击链接</span></span></span></strong></a></p><p><span>2.</span><span>博士生导师可同时招收直博生和硕士生，硕士生导师仅可招收硕士生。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>化学系<span>2026</span>级专业学位硕士研究生执行收费标准为<span>4</span>万元<span>/</span>生·全程。</span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>报名时请慎重填报推免专业和类型，复试时将以浙大推免系统中填报的志愿为准。</span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：</span><span><span>yanjiang@zju.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>浙江大学化学系</span></p><p><span>2025</span><span>年<span>7</span>月<span>28</span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"9a45026ab7e941e04c9b1ff6c0b0431f52323d5dbdb0a72771c6e517688f50c9","textLength":715,"sourceSha256":"8639acbb43ef897d3a6903b443bce1e943f024696f6e258d3f73cfa1107654d6","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-015ef8db1feaa7ed90a2","title":"2025年浙江大学化学系关于2026年接收推荐免试研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:37.248466+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.chem.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/52686959dcbd6ca4246b.gif"}]}
